📘
  This package allows you to parse JSON.

  Example:

  ```
  🍺 🔲 🍺⚪️🕊🌸 🔤{"a": 32, "b": 43, "c": -92}🔤❗️🍯🐚⚪️🍆➡️ dict

  🍺🔲🐽dict 🔤b🔤❗️🔢  💭 Gets the value for b
  ```
📘

📗
  🚧🔸🌸 an error that occured when parsing a JSON text.
